Z||000000||David Bartlett||11-10-2001||04:53 PM||||How many kilometers can you get on a 36L gastank with a NorthStar setup? Do you guys install a bigger tank?||||reg||1
Z||000001||FieroBUZZ||11-10-2001||05:04 PM||||IMHO anyone who can afford a North* swap shouldn't be worried about gas mileage.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||mrfiero||11-10-2001||06:54 PM||||It's my understanding that the Northstar will get about the same mileage as a stock V-6 Fiero.  So figure 20-25 MPG city & 25-30 MPG highway.  I'm not sure how to convert that to metric, but you get the idea.<P>You can't really install a bigger tank, so you're pretty much stuck with what you have.<P>My question is what is the top speed of a Northstar in a Fiero?  Is it any faster than the Cadillacs they come in originally?   Anyone know?<BR>||||reg||1
