Z||000005||artherd||11-10-2001||08:39 PM||||Hi Dave, I don't think the Fiero is terribly aerodynamically efficent at around 160 or so.  V^squared and all.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Caddys get nearly 30mpg highway.... <P>The way I drive? I'll never know, or care  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Best!<BR>Ben<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">    <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red           &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
Z||000006||mrfiero||11-10-2001||08:51 PM||||OK.....I finally got smart and went to Cadillacs website.  According to them the mileage ranges from 17-26 MPG.  Keep in mind that this is in a 3850 pound car......with the Fiero you easily lope off 800-1000 pounds, so the mileage will top 30MPG on the highway.<P>Also, the top speed depends on the model. I went to the Eldorado page to get this info and the "ETC" gets the 300HP/295 torque N* and has a top speed of 150 MPH.  The "ESC" has a 275HP/300 torque N* and has a top speed of 112.  I imagine (like what ray b said) that  the difference in top speed is the ECM.<P>I am getting closer to convincing myself to go the N* route......150MPH sounds good to me!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by mrfiero (edited 11-10-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000007||Jay||11-10-2001||09:33 PM||||I average about 20mpg.  Yes, you are right the ecm has alot to do with how fast you can go.  That is the problem I'm experiencing at the track.  I run out of speed just before the finish line.  It's being worked on by a chip programmer as we speak.  BTW before you do a swap, my car is for sale at a very reasonable price.  Check it out at <A HREF="http://www.members.home.net/jaygrande" TARGET=_blank>www.members.home.net/jaygrande</A>   Much cheaper than you could ever build one for.  e-mail me for more info. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newsig2_copy_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
