Z||000010||mrfiero||11-10-2001||09:48 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Jay:<BR><B>$10 US or the Canadian equivilent which should be somewhere around ONE BILLION DOLLARS  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Or best offer.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I'll give you ten bucks in a heartbeat!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I'm sure you meant $10K US.......I'll have to think about it.  I would rather do it to an '88 GT or an early Fiero with an '88 cradle to take advantage of the better (in my opinion) rear suspension set-up.<P>I'll let you know.<P>||||reg||1
