Z||000016||86 FIERO GT||11-11-2001||05:37 PM||||Actually its limited to 158 because of the type of tires they came with.  You should get alittle better gas mileage than a eldo or STS since you have a lighter car.  I plan on using the N* with the 4T80E trans and the wiring harness and computers for both, so i should be getting 25-30 mpg with that setup.<P>***BTW a Northstar is around 7 grand for a brand new one in the crate from GM***<p>[This message has been edited by 86 FIERO GT (edited 11-11-2001).]||||reg||1
